  "body": "PR 3 of 3 for OpenProject FZT-51 (https://openproject.home.romaine.life/wp/2098). Bumps to fzt v0.2.77 and fzt-terminal v0.1.103, so in a folder picker Enter picks the highlighted, typed or current folder, and Right, Space, Tab or a click goes in. The border title now starts with the mode (\"󰉋 Folder picker\" or \"File picker\"), followed by the caller's --title; the popup no longer passes its window caption as that title. Tested in the standalone picker through tmux.",
